+# jhipsterSampleApplication
+
+JHipster 9 monolith: Spring Boot 3 backend (Java 21, Maven) and Angular frontend in `src/main/webapp`.
+It manages bank accounts, operations and labels for users with JWT authentication.
+Admins manage users under `/api/admin/users`.
+
+## Notes
+
+- [[sessions/2026-11-01]]: admin endpoint for logins of users created in the last 7 days, and the `Clock` bean.
