+# 2026-11-01
+
+## Done
+
+- Added `GET /api/admin/users/recently-created` (admin only) returning the logins of users created in the last 7 days, sorted by login.
+- Query lives in `UserRepository.findLoginsCreatedAfter`; the 7-day boundary and the call live in `UserService.getLoginsRecentlyCreated`.
+- Added a `Clock` bean in `config/ClockConfiguration`; `UserService` takes it so "now" is injected, as `src/main/java/CLAUDE.md` requires.
+- Added `UserResourceIT` tests for the window (8-day-old user excluded) and for non-admin access (403).
+- Build not run, per request.
+
+## Next
+
+- Run `./mvnw verify` to check the new tests and the Spring context with the `Clock` bean.
+- `AbstractAuditingEntity` still uses `Instant.now()` for `createdDate`; left as is because it is outside this change.
